        en: "Many people use Withings in combination with another device: a sports watch for workouts, or simply the smartphone for daily steps. The challenge is that each brand tends to create its own closed ecosystem, and switching between apps to understand how the week went is not practical. A unified dashboard solves exactly this: it aggregates data from different sources in one place, accessible from a browser without having to open each individual app.",
