        en: "Partly. Weight arrives regularly. For fat, muscle and hydration it depends on the scale model and app version: some metrics are transmitted, others remain only in Health Mate. You can check by opening Health Connect and looking at which data types Withings has written. For detailed body composition, the Health Mate app remains the place where you see everything.",
